ortp
------------------------------------------
oRTP is a GPLv2 licensed C library implementing the RTP protocol (rfc3550).

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbctoolbox1-5.4.130-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libortp-devel-5.4.130-1bl1
  libortp15-5.4.130-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.11-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libbctoolbox-devel-5.4.130-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/BelledonneCommunications/ortp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/BelledonneCommunications/ortp/archive/refs/tags/5.4.130.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack ortp-5.4.130-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./ortp-5.4.130-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/ortp-5.4.130-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/ortp-5.4.130-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libortp15-5.4.130-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libortp-devel-5.4.130-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

